            "type": "text",
            "text": "The fourth stage of aerobic respiration, oxidative phosphorylation, involves the process of chemiosmosis. Chemiosmosis also occurs in photosynthesis.",
            "source": {
              "qp": 3
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "During chemiosmosis, ions move across a membrane down their electrochemical gradient.",
            "source": {
              "qp": 3
            }
          },
